.TH std::queue::~queue 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::queue::~queue \- std::queue::~queue

.SH Synopsis
~queue();

A destructor. Destructs the queue. The destructors of the elements are called and the used
storage is deallocated. Note, that if the elements are pointers, the pointed-to objects
are not destroyed.

.SH Complexity

Linear in the size of the queue.
